#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:154
msgid "Key Pairs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:156
msgid ""
"The key pairs section enables the following actions: Add and Delete key "
"pairs. Key pairs are commonly used by |morpheus| for accessing instances "
"via SSH. |morpheus| stores key pairs to simplify administration and "
"access across both private and public clouds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:158
msgid ""
"|morpheus| only accepts key pairs in PEM format (for example, a private "
"key beginning with ``-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----``). If you have a "
"key in another format, such as OpenSSH, convert the key:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:160
msgid ""
"#No passphrase\n"
"ssh-keygen -m pem -f /path/to/key\n"
"\n"
"#With passphrase\n"
"ssh-keygen -p -P \"old passphrase\" -N \"new passphrase\" -m pem -f "
"path/to/key"
msgstr ""

